WEBVTT

00:15:59.000 --> 00:16:04.487
And so I printed out and sent
a PDF of her blog to her family,

00:16:04.511 --> 00:16:06.710
and they passed it
out at her memorial service,

00:16:06.734 --> 00:16:09.096
and even in her obituary,
they mentioned her blog,

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:11.129
because it was such
a big part of her life.

00:16:11.153 --> 00:16:12.390
And that's a huge thing.

00:16:12.414 --> 00:16:15.379
So, this is her legacy,

00:16:15.403 --> 00:16:18.699
and I think that my call to action
to all of you is:

00:16:18.723 --> 00:16:20.880
think about blogs,
think about what they are,

00:16:20.904 --> 00:16:22.832
think about what you've thought of them,

00:16:22.856 --> 00:16:24.021
and then actually do it,

00:16:24.045 --> 00:16:27.043
because it's something
that's really going to change our lives.

00:16:27.067 --> 00:16:28.229
So, thank you.

00:16:28.253 --> 00:16:29.253
(Applause)